            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">Estresse piora dores crônicas como dor ciática</p>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="py-20 bg-white text-center">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl text-primary font-bold mb-6">Recupere o equilíbrio. Agende sua avaliação</h2>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 mt-4">
          <a href="https://wa.me/5511983134656?text=Ol%C3%A1,%20gostaria%20de%20agendar%20minha%20avalia%C3%A7%C3%A3o%20para%20estresse.&utm_source=site&utm_medium=estresse_final&utm_campaign=whatsapp_agendamento" class="bg-secondary text-white px-10 py-5 rounded-full font-bold text-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-3 animate-pulse-slow" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            💬 Agendar com a Dra. Valda
          </a>
          <a href="tel:+5511983134656" class="bg-white text-primary border-2 border-primary px-10 py-5 rounded-full font-bold text-xl shadow-lg hover:shadow-xl transition-all inline-flex items-center gap-3">
